`]}),e.jsx(r,{title:"The card's FSDP field means ZeRO-2-style sharding",children:e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The sharding field of the Llama 3 card reads FSDP. The run shards the gradients and the optimizer state across its data-parallel ranks and keeps the gathered parameters resident from forward until backward, without resharding them after the forward pass ",e.jsx(s,{id:"llama3-2024",children:"Grattafiori et al., 2024"}),". On the ZeRO ladder that is ZeRO-2-style sharding, not ZeRO-3. You build the first stage, ZeRO-1, from raw collectives."]})})]}),e.jsxs(a,{title:"HSDP shards inside a group and replicates across groups",reading:!0,accent:1,number:"27",items:"4",children:[e.jsxs(t.ul,{children:[`
